########################
# ANARCI INSTALLATION  #
########################

Requirements:
    - Python >= 3.8
    - pyhmmer (installed automatically as a package dependency)

To install from a checkout:

    pip install .
    # or: uv pip install -e .

To install as a git dependency (e.g. with uv):

    # In your pyproject.toml:
    # [tool.uv.sources]
    # anarci = { git = "https://github.com/cmoscy/ANARCI-pyhmmr.git" }

Germline alignments and HMM databases are bundled with the package. They are
not downloaded during installation.

To regenerate packaged data from IMGT (maintainers only), see
build_pipeline/README.md.

For help see README or run:

    ANARCI -h
